// Chat Messages and Help
{10000}{Arcanum and WON.net CHAT Help File}
{10001}{CHAT COMMANDS:}
{10002}{/AFK - Sets you Away From Keyboard.}
{10003}{/BAN <name> <time> - Bans a client, time can be any positive number }
{10004}{                     followed by D for days, H for hours, M for minutes.}
{10005}{/JOIN <name or number> - Joins the channel specified by the name or number.}
{10006}{/HELP - Prints this message here.}
{10007}{/I <name> - Ignores or un-ignores a client.}
{10008}{/ME <message> - Emotes a message.}
{10009}{: <message> - Same as the /ME command.}
{10010}{/MOD - Change a moderator status.}
{10011}{/MUTE <name> <time> - Mutes a client. Time is the same format as ban.}
{10012}{/UNMUTE <name> - Un mutes a client.}
{10013}{/W <name> <mesg> - Whisper. Sends a private message to one recepient.}
{10014}{/WHO - Lists all the clients currently in the chatroom.}
{10015}{Otherwise all text is sent to the current channel you are in.}

{10050}{Could not join chatroom %d.}
